  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2b1d13df9c3129c8de442ecf2124d25d675a4cc_0.webp\" alt=\"带有风铃图标和文字“风铃”的横幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本模组是对原版公共领域 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwindchimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">风铃模组</a> 的忠实延续，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhibi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hibi</a> 制作。</p>\n<p>本项目的目标是在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 平台上，持续更新该模组的内容以适配现代 Minecraft 版本。</p>\n<p><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:959px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rWKBhm5CV1g?si=4de1KMWHPU4AKAL8&controls=0\" width=\"765\" height=\"586\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<hr>",
